{"channelId":"UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","row":["Niagara College",8010,"At Niagara College, more than 10,500 full-time students study in over 130 diploma, graduate certificate, apprenticeship and Bachelor’s Degree programs.\nWe also welcome Part-Time Studies registrants, who study in 18 part-time programs and 2400 classes in roughly 350 different credit, vocational and general interest courses annually.\nWe are proud of our graduates, who possess cultural and global competencies; they are innovative, adaptable and entrepreneurial, pushing the boundaries of the possible for industry in Niagara, in Canada and abroad.\nNiagara College features two campuses located in the Niagara Region, Ontario, Canada. Our recently renovated campuses are part of a 65 million dollar campus redevelopment project—part of our strategy to embrace a transformational shift in learning and support a culture of modernization in our programs and services.","international@niagaracollege.ca","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.230Z","channelId":"UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d0b8d603ebc5306a84d3ca567c044df6823cb7dc2e637b6a066be8cd69772b5e","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"3f599d916428312a9886af1b364e561fccba85cee69ff57a89d7cab726adaa4e"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.230Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":8010,"raw":"8.01K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIRFiKH3v05OqUX9kq-llvQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:46.230Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"international@niagaracollege.ca","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identit